{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require all schools to teach ADHD & neurodiversity education",
        "additional_details": "Through my lived experience, campaigns and the free education initiative I provide whilst touring schools with, I have seen the importance of the Government introducing mandatory, age-appropriate education on ADHD and neurodiversity in schools to reduce stigma and improving understanding and inclusion.",
        "background": "We want the Government to require schools to provide age-appropriate education in every school about ADHD and neurodiversity, to help reduce stigma, improve inclusion and ensure all children, staff and parents are educated about these conditions.",
